@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api/computers
@objectGuid = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List computer accounts directly inside the configured domain Computers container
GET {{baseUrl}}/unassigned

### Move one eligible computer by its Active Directory object GUID
POST {{baseUrl}}/unassigned/{{objectGuid}}/move
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Invalid object GUID returns 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/unassigned/not-a-guid/move
Content-Type: application/json

{}
